@mar23_scrutiny
title: Defend historical scrutiny and secular public institutions
on-arrival: church_2023_stance = "Historical scrutiny"; progressive_credibility += 4; constitutional_restraint += 3; ko_relation += 2; psl_relation -= 5; far_right_agenda += 3; barons_dissent += 4; news_headline = "The Left refuses a state-enforced sacred memory"

Lewica votes against a parliamentary article of faith and demands access to
Church and state archives alike. Secular voters recognise the old fight against
clerical privilege. Some practising Catholics hear contempt where we intended
method, and PiS gratefully makes that misunderstanding the story.

- @poland_events_2023_04.mar23_resolution: The resolution reaches the chamber


@mar23_survivors
title: Centre survivors, archives and institutional accountability
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The support network lacks capacity.
on-arrival: church_2023_stance = "Survivors first"; resources -= 1; public_trust += 4; progressive_credibility += 3; feminist_trust += 2; psl_relation -= 1; civic_patriotism += 1; news_headline = "Survivor support displaces the symbolic shouting match"

The party pays for lawyers, counselling referrals and an archive team instead
of another studio quarrel. Survivors acquire somewhere to take testimony that
does not begin by asking what it will do to a national icon. The Sejm still
shouts about memory, but Lewica has made institutional accountability tangible.

- @poland_events_2023_04.mar23_resolution: The resolution reaches the chamber


@mar23_distinguish
title: Reject collective contempt while protecting the inquiry
on-arrival: church_2023_stance = "Faith without impunity"; public_trust += 3; psl_relation += 2; constitutional_restraint += 2; progressive_credibility += 1; barons_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "The Left separates faith from institutional impunity"

Our speakers refuse both the state's canonisation and the lazy claim that Polish
Catholicism is one guilty body. Parish Catholics willing to open the archives
find room beside secular campaigners. Harder voices on both sides call it
evasion; survivors at least keep their claim to facts rather than symbols.

- @poland_events_2023_04.mar23_resolution: The resolution reaches the chamber


@mar23_avoid
title: Leave the memory war to PiS and KO
on-arrival: church_2023_stance = "Stayed out"; public_trust -= 2; media_capacity -= 1; far_right_agenda += 2; psl_relation += 1; public_mood_pending_secular_state_support += -4; public_mood_pending_secular_state_left_ownership += -4; news_headline = "The Left disappears from the month's defining argument"

PiS defends the pope, KO calibrates its distance, and Lewica changes the subject.
The party avoids an argument that can swallow every other issue, but it also
leaves survivors and secular institutions without its parliamentary voice.
Silence proves no safer than taking a side: everyone supplies a motive for us.

- @poland_events_2023_04.mar23_resolution: The resolution reaches the chamber
